{"page":"record","mainClass":"shell app-main","main":"<div id=\"connection-error\" class=\"notice error\" role=\"alert\" hidden><p id=\"connection-error-text\"></p><div class=\"actions\"><button class=\"button small\" data-retry-state>Retry connection</button><button class=\"button small\" data-follow-current>Follow current run</button></div></div><div id=\"action-message\" class=\"notice\" role=\"status\" hidden></div><div class=\"page-heading reveal\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\"><i class=\"status-dot\"></i> 03 / Agent record · Evidence over reputation</p><h1>Every claim has a source.</h1><p>Inspect the selected run’s deployment, decisions, receipts, and final checks. A record you can interrogate without taking a story on trust.</p></div><div class=\"heading-aside\">Chain evidence first.<br>Local judgments labeled.<br>Nothing inferred.</div></div><section class=\"surface reveal\"><div class=\"section-head\"><div><p class=\"section-label\">Find a saved demonstration</p><h2>Open the evidence trail.</h2></div><span class=\"pill\">Run-scoped archive</span></div><form id=\"record-lookup-form\" class=\"inline-form\"><div class=\"field\"><label for=\"record-lookup\">Run ID, GuardAccount address, or run label</label><input id=\"record-lookup\" name=\"record\" type=\"search\" required placeholder=\"Paste a run ID or 0x address\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"></div><button class=\"button primary\" type=\"submit\">Look up record ↗</button></form><p class=\"snapshot-note\">This searches the local server’s saved runs. It does not resolve ENS names or scan unrelated public-chain activity.</p><div id=\"lookup-message\" class=\"notice\" role=\"status\" hidden></div><ul id=\"record-search-results\" class=\"search-results\" aria-label=\"Matching saved runs\"></ul></section><div id=\"record-no-run\" class=\"notice section\" hidden>No record selected. Start a live demo or search for a saved run above.</div><div id=\"record-outcome\" class=\"notice error section\" role=\"alert\" hidden></div><section class=\"two-column section\"><div class=\"surface reveal\"><div class=\"section-head\"><div><p class=\"section-label\">Identity &amp; time</p><h2>Run identity</h2></div><span class=\"pill\">Not an attestation</span></div><dl id=\"record-metadata\" class=\"ledger\"><div><dt>Run</dt><dd>Select a saved run to begin.</dd></div></dl></div><div class=\"surface reveal\"><div class=\"section-head\"><div><p class=\"section-label\">The outcome</p><h2>Verified checks</h2></div><button id=\"record-copy-run\" class=\"button small\" data-copy=\"run\" disabled>Copy run ID</button></div><div id=\"record-checks\" class=\"check-list\"><p class=\"fine-print\">A final result supplies these checks. A process exit is not enough.</p></div><p class=\"trust-note\">Owner-origin denial is a local SDK and judgment demonstration, not a fabricated claim transaction. Each check links its receipt when one exists.</p></div></section><section class=\"two-column section\"><div class=\"surface reveal\"><div class=\"section-head\"><div><p class=\"section-label\">Contracts &amp; authorities</p><h2>Deployment record</h2></div><span class=\"pill\">Arc testnet</span></div><dl id=\"record-contracts\" class=\"ledger\"><div><dt>Contracts</dt><dd>Deployment not selected</dd></div></dl><details class=\"disclosure\"><summary>Recorded actors &amp; registries <span class=\"chevron\">+</span></summary><div class=\"disclosure-body\"><dl id=\"record-actors\" class=\"ledger\"></dl><dl id=\"record-registries\" class=\"ledger\"></dl></div></details></div><div class=\"surface reveal\"><div class=\"section-head\"><div><p class=\"section-label\">Policy &amp; balances</p><h2>What was protected</h2></div></div><div id=\"record-policy\"><p class=\"fine-print\">Waiting for a verified policy event.</p></div><div id=\"record-wallets\" class=\"wallet-list\"></div><p id=\"record-snapshot-note\" class=\"snapshot-note\">No snapshot yet.</p></div></section><section class=\"section reveal\"><div class=\"secti